Permanently fixes the vanilla Gothic engine bug where trailing water bubble particle emitter trails continuously spawn attached to the player head after swimming and diving, eliminating FPS drops and visual clutter.

Package contains 100% transparent zero-alpha textures replacing the bubble emitters.

